        {
          "text": "Lino nikwamana ciindi cilamfu, Jehova naakamana kupa bana baIsrayeli kulyokezya kwakutakataazigwa kuli basinkondonyina boonse bazyungulukide, alimwi Joshua naakacembaala akuba amyaka minji, ",
