        {
          "text": "Lino mebo ndatola inzila njibatola bantu boonse. Mulizi camyoyo yanu yoonse acamiyeeyo yanu yoonse kuti taakwe cintu niciba comwe icakawida ansi akati kazintu zibotu zyoonse Jehova Leza wanu nzyakaamba aandinywe. Zyoonse buyo zyakacitika, taakwe niciba comwe icakawida ansi. ",
