        {
          "text": "Lino mbubonya mbumwasikilwa zintu zyoonse zibotu Jehova Leza wanu nzyaakamwaambila, aboobo Jehova uyoomuletela zintu zyoonse zibi, mane akamunyonyoone kuzwa munyika eyi imbotu Jehova Leza wanu njaamupede. ",
          "type": "text",
