        {
          "text": "Na mwasotoka cizuminano ca-Jehova Leza wanu ncaakamulailila, akuya bumanina mizimu myeenzu milimo akwiikotamina, elyo bukali bwa-Jehova buyoomubukila, muyoofwambaana kunyonyooka kuzwa munyika imbotu njaakamupa.",
          "type": "text",
